     "titulo": "The imperative and sequence words",
     "texto": [
      "The imperative gives instructions: **Fyll beholderen** («Fill the container»), **Sett på lokket** («Put on the lid»). The sequence words **først**, **deretter** and **til slutt** show the order of the steps.",
